# TESTING (PRIORITY NUMBER 1)

1. to_human and humanize methods for AST
    - to_human() -> String
    - display_human(&self, f: std::fmt::Formatter<'_>) -> std::fmt::Result<()>
2. whole testing mod with utilities for testing AST
    ```
    assert_eq!(
        binary(
            num("120"),
            BinOp::Plus,
            cast(bool(true), ty_ident("number")),
        ).to_human(),
        parser.parse_expr().to_human(),
    );
    ```